  "question": {
    "text": "The set of values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> for which local extremum values of the function <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> are positive where <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> and maxima occurs at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
