      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
