      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
